§ `Tests of ss 102 and 103`

§§ `s 102`
-- args: there is a unanimous shareholder agreement; it restricts the powers of the directors in the matter
#ASSERT `the directors must manage or supervise the management of the business and affairs within s 102(1)` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the directors must manage or supervise the management of the business and affairs within s 102(1)` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the directors must manage or supervise the management of the business and affairs within s 102(1)` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the directors must manage or supervise the management of the business and affairs within s 102(1)` TRUE TRUE)
-- args: the number of directors; distributing corporation; issued securities outstanding and held by more than one person; the number of directors who are not officers or employees of the corporation or its affiliates
#ASSERT NOT (`the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 0 FALSE FALSE 0)
#ASSERT `the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 1 FALSE FALSE 0
#ASSERT NOT (`the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 1 TRUE TRUE 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 2 TRUE TRUE 2)
#ASSERT NOT (`the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 3 TRUE TRUE 1)
#ASSERT `the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 3 TRUE TRUE 2
#ASSERT `the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 5 TRUE TRUE 2
#ASSERT `the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 3 TRUE FALSE 0
#ASSERT `the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 1 TRUE FALSE 0
#ASSERT `the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 3 FALSE TRUE 0
#ASSERT `the number of directors complies within s 102(2)` 2 FALSE FALSE 0

§§ `s 103(1) and (2)`
-- args: the by-law regulates the business or affairs of the corporation; the articles, by-laws or a unanimous shareholder agreement otherwise provide
#ASSERT `the directors may make, amend or repeal the by-law by resolution within s 103(1)` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the directors may make, amend or repeal the by-law by resolution within s 103(1)` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the directors may make, amend or repeal the by-law by resolution within s 103(1)` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the directors must submit the by-law to the shareholders at the next meeting within s 103(2)` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the directors must submit the by-law to the shareholders at the next meeting within s 103(2)` FALSE)
-- args: the by-law was submitted to the shareholders; the resolution is an ordinary resolution
#ASSERT `the shareholders may confirm, reject or amend the by-law within s 103(2)` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the shareholders may confirm, reject or amend the by-law within s 103(2)` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the shareholders may confirm, reject or amend the by-law within s 103(2)` FALSE TRUE)

§§ `s 103(3) and (4)`
-- args: what the shareholders did; the next meeting of shareholders has been held; the directors submitted the by-law at that meeting
#ASSERT `the status of the by-law within s 103(3)` `the shareholders have not yet acted on it` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `in effect from the date of the directors' resolution, awaiting the shareholders`
#ASSERT `the status of the by-law within s 103(3)` `the shareholders have not yet acted on it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `in effect from the date of the directors' resolution, awaiting the shareholders`
#ASSERT `the status of the by-law within s 103(3)` `the shareholders have not yet acted on it` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no longer effective`
#ASSERT `the status of the by-law within s 103(3)` `the shareholders rejected it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `no longer effective`
#ASSERT `the status of the by-law within s 103(3)` `the shareholders rejected it` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no longer effective`
#ASSERT `the status of the by-law within s 103(3)` `the shareholders confirmed it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `in effect in the form in which the shareholders confirmed it`
#ASSERT `the status of the by-law within s 103(3)` `the shareholders confirmed it as amended` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `in effect in the form in which the shareholders confirmed it as amended`
#ASSERT `the status of the by-law within s 103(3)` `the shareholders confirmed it` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `in effect in the form in which the shareholders confirmed it`
-- args: the earlier by-law ceased to be effective under s 103(4); the later resolution has substantially the same purpose or effect; the shareholders have confirmed the later resolution
#ASSERT NOT (`the later resolution of the directors is effective within s 103(4)` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the later resolution of the directors is effective within s 103(4)` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `the later resolution of the directors is effective within s 103(4)` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the later resolution of the directors is effective within s 103(4)` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the later resolution of the directors is effective within s 103(4)` FALSE FALSE FALSE
-- args: a shareholder entitled to vote at an annual meeting; the proposal is made in accordance with section 137
#ASSERT `the shareholder may make a proposal to make, amend or repeal a by-law within s 103(5)` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the shareholder may make a proposal to make, amend or repeal a by-law within s 103(5)` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the shareholder may make a proposal to make, amend or repeal a by-law within s 103(5)` TRUE FALSE)
